                <invention-title lang="de">DATENEINHEIT IN EINEM DRAHTLOSEN SYSTEM</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">UNITÉ DE DONNÉES DANS UN SYSTÈME SANS FIL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">DATA UNIT IN WIRELESS SYSTEM</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A method for a wireless device of a wireless communication system is described herein. In accordance with one embodiment, the method includes receiving - by the wireless device from a session management function (SMF) - a message for a protocol data unit (PDU) session establishment, wherein the message comprises a configuration information for determining one or more packets that are of a plurality of packets of a data unit (DU). The method further includes determining - by the wireless device and based on the configuration information - that a first packet is one of a first plurality of packets of a first data unit (DU), and sending - by the wireless device - a first message comprising the first packet. Moreover, a corresponding wireless device as well as related devices and systems are described herein.</p>
            </abstract>
